#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ýüz tanamaklyk (tapylan gapjyk: {}) ulanyp, {}-y awtomatiki "
"açyp biler.\n"
"\n"
"<b> TPM ýagdaýy: </b> TPM 2.0 enjamlary işjeň. Parolyňyz TPM-iň içinde "
"ygtybarly möhürlener."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ýüz tanamak arkaly {} awtomatiki açyp biler (tapylan gapjyk: "
"{}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM ýagdaýy:</b> TPM enjamy tapyldy, ýöne <i>tpm2-tools</i> awtomatiki "
"gurnalmady. <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code> buýrugyny işlediň. "
"Programma esasly şahsy maglumat keşine geçilýär."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ýüz tanamaklyk (tapylan gapjyk: {}) ulanyp, {}-y awtomatiki "
"açyp biler.\n"
"\n"
"<b> TPM ýagdaýy: </b> TPM enjamy tapylmady. Programma üpjünçiligine "
"esaslanýan şahsyýet keşini (AES-256-GCM) ulanmak."

